---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout locale="en" title="Collaborate with Astrmira" description="Begin a research or engineering collaboration with Astrmira." route="collaborate">
  <div class="wrap"><section class="page-title"><p class="eyebrow">COLLABORATE / BEGIN WITH A QUESTION</p><h1>The next question<br /><em>starts with you.</em></h1><p>Bring a real scenario, an open question, or a research plan. We begin by making the problem clear, then decide how to move forward together.</p></section>
    <section class="contact-grid"><div class="contact-side"><h2>Let us begin with the problem.</h2><p>Describe the context, existing foundation, and desired outcome to generate a concise collaboration brief.</p><div class="contact-aspects"><div><span>Databases and retrieval</span><span>SYSTEMS</span></div><div><span>Agent applications</span><span>INTELLIGENCE</span></div><div><span>Research and universities</span><span>RESEARCH</span></div></div></div>
      <form class="contact-form" data-brief-form data-locale="en"><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label for="contact-name">Your name (optional)</label><input id="contact-name" name="name" placeholder="Name" maxlength="100" autocomplete="name" /></div><div class="field"><label for="contact-org">Organization or team (optional)</label><input id="contact-org" name="organization" placeholder="University, lab, or company" maxlength="180" autocomplete="organization" /></div></div><div class="field"><label for="contact-area">Collaboration area</label><select id="contact-area" name="area"><option>Joint research</option><option>Databases and retrieval systems</option><option>Agent platforms and applications</option><option>Another question worth discussing</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="contact-problem">What problem would you like to solve together? *</label><textarea id="contact-problem" name="problem" placeholder="Context, current foundation, and the outcome you hope to reach…" required minlength="8" maxlength="5000"></textarea></div><div class="form-actions"><button type="submit" class="button button-primary">Generate collaboration brief <span class="arrow">↗</span></button><span class="tiny-note">You can copy or download it.<br />Nothing is sent automatically.</span></div><div class="brief-result" data-brief-result hidden><h3>Your collaboration brief</h3><pre data-brief-text></pre><div class="brief-actions"><button class="button" type="button" data-copy-brief>Copy text</button><button class="button" type="button" data-download-brief>Save as .txt ↓</button></div><p class="tiny-note" data-brief-status role="status" style="margin-top:13px">The brief was generated locally and has not been sent.</p></div></form>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
